      "name": "Room",
      "version": "2.8.0-beta01",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/room#2.8.0-beta01",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Table and view names are now escaped properly during destructive migrations. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/frameworks/support/+/3702219\">9e55f8</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/427095319\">b/427095319</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
